.TH CONFIG.YAML 5 "2026-10-06" "mu2edaq-CFOControl t01.00.00" "Mu2e DAQ Manual"
.SH NAME
config.yaml \- CFOControl connection, timeout and logging configuration
.SH SYNOPSIS
.I mu2edaq\-CFOControl/config.yaml
.SH DESCRIPTION
YAML file read by
.BR CFOControl.py (1)
at start-up.
It is loaded with
.B yaml.safe_load
and deep-merged over the built-in defaults
.RI ( CFOControl.py:55\-68 ),
so any key may be omitted.
Unknown keys are ignored.
Without
.B \-\-config
the file is looked for next to
.IR CFOControl.py ,
not in the current directory; if it is absent the defaults are used silently.
.PP
Precedence: command-line option, then this file, then built-in default.
No environment variable is read.
.SH KEYS
.TP
.B connection.host
MacroMaker host: IPv4 address, IPv6 address or hostname.
Default
.BR 127.0.0.1 .
Overridden by
.BR \-\-host .
.TP
.B connection.port
MacroMaker UDP port.
Default
.BR 5000 .
Overridden by
.BR \-\-port ;
because
.BR start\-mu2edaq\-cfocontrol.sh (1)
always passes
.BR \-\-port ,
this key has no effect on the control-room launch path.
The value must match
.B OTS_MACROMAKER_UDP_PORT
in the MacroMaker supervisor's environment.
.TP
.B timeouts.first_packet
Seconds to wait for the first reply datagram.
Default
.BR 10.0 .
A macro that runs longer than this is reported as an empty response (exit 1)
but is not cancelled on the server and may already have run.
.TP
.B timeouts.next_packet
Seconds to wait for each further datagram of a multi-datagram reply.
Default
.BR 0.2 .
The first gap longer than this ends the reply; a late fragment is silently
dropped and the reply is used as if complete.
.TP
.B logging.level
Python logging level name:
.BR DEBUG ,
.BR INFO ,
.B WARNING
or
.BR ERROR .
Default
.BR INFO .
An unknown name falls back to
.BR INFO .
.TP
.B logging.verbose_udp
Print raw datagrams to stdout.
Default
.BR false .
Forced true by
.BR \-v .
.SH FILES
.TP
.I config.yaml
in the directory of
.IR CFOControl.py .
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
connection:
  host: "mu2e\-cfo\-01.fnal.gov"
  port: 5000
timeouts:
  first_packet: 30.0
  next_packet: 0.5
logging:
  level: DEBUG
  verbose_udp: false
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR CFOControl.py (1),
.BR start\-mu2edaq\-cfocontrol.sh (1),
.BR ots_mm_udp_interface (3)
.SH AUTHOR
Mu2e DAQ group, Fermilab.
